"APs whose occupied frequencies overlap (including co-channel). Partial overlap is worse than sharing a channel: the APs can't coordinate and just see each other as noise." = "AP cuyas frecuencias ocupadas se superponen (incluidos los del mismo canal). La superposición parcial es peor que compartir canal: los AP no pueden coordinarse y simplemente se perciben como ruido.";
